  "post_title": "El primer encierro de toros bravos de Fira d'Onda se salda con un revolcón",
  "post_date": "2014-10-23 12:14:17",
  "post_name": "el-primer-encierro-de-toros-bravos-de-fira-donda-se-salda-con-un-revolcon",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/10/IMG_5408.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>66 fotos del primer encierro este jueves de toros bravos de Fira d&#39;Onda 2014, organizado por el Consell de Festes con reses de la ganader&iacute;a El Romal. Ha sido tranquilo y lento, y se ha saldado con un revolc&oacute;n a un mozo de San Sebasti&aacute;n de los Reyes. Le han atentido en la enfermer&iacute;a del recinto y ha salido por su propio pie.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerencierrofira14/img_5335.jpg\" alt=\"img_5335\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerencierrofira14/img_5337.jpg\" alt=\"img_5337\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerencierrofira14/img_5339.jpg\" alt=\"img_5339\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerencierrofira14/img_5340.jpg\" alt=\"img_5340\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerencierrofira14/img_5341.jpg\" alt=\"img_5341\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerencierrofira14/img_5342.jpg\" alt=\"img_5342\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerencierrofira14/img_5343.jpg\" alt=\"img_5343\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerencierrofira14/img_5347.jpg\" alt=\"img_5347\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/primerencierrofira14/img_5349.jpg\" alt=\"img_5349\" style=\"max-width:100%;